      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this change feels pretty subtle, so the explanation of the problem and how this change resolves it needs some improvement.\n\nThen we need to understand if the change in the vendorhook call location (and locks held) might negatively impact other vendor implementations, and if this needs to be addressed via a new vendorhook instead to avoid impacting existing semantics.",
      "revId": "8759a1bd421e2c65cc888c636db889522f1ccca6",
